---
export const prerender = false;
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
import MobileNav from "../components/layout/MobileNav.astro";
const sections = [
  ["What this website is", "SF Tree Removal operates a public information portal for the tree care industry in South Florida. It publishes (1) leads compiled from public tree-related permit records, (2) a directory of tree-service and equipment operators compiled from publicly available business information, and (3) a blog. Visitors do not need an account, and this website does not offer sign-up, inquiry or contact forms."],
  ["Information we collect from visitors", "When you browse, we keep a simple first-party page-view log: the page path and title, a randomly generated session identifier stored in your browser, the referring page, UTM campaign parameters if present, and your browser's user-agent string. We do not store your IP address in this log and we do not ask for your name or contact details. Your cookie preferences are also saved in your browser. Authorized administrators who sign in to a restricted area have authentication data processed to keep that area secure."],
  ["Cookies, analytics and advertising tags", "Essential storage keeps the site working and remembers your cookie choice. If you allow analytics or marketing in the cookie banner, we may load Google's tag (Google Analytics / Google Ads) so that Google can set cookies and measure usage. You can change your choice by clearing this site's data in your browser, and you can block cookies in your browser settings. Blocking essential storage may affect how the site works."],
  ["Permit records and the people named in them", "The permit leads shown on this website come from public government permit filings. A listing can include the property address, permit type and description, dates, and — where the filing includes them — the applicant or owner's name, phone number and email address exactly as recorded by the issuing jurisdiction. We did not obtain this information through private accounts or unauthorized access. It is republished to help tree care businesses find local work. We also keep internal records about each permit (such as status, score and activity history)."],
  ["Emails we may send about permit records", "We may send a one-to-one email to an email address that appears in a public permit filing, about that permit. These emails include a \"Do not contact me again\" link. When you use it, or if an address bounces or reports a message as spam, we stop sending to that address. Our emails may include a small tracking image and a tracked link so we can tell whether a message was opened or clicked. We send at most a limited number of messages per permit."],
  ["Directory listings", "The contractor directory shows business information collected from public sources, such as company name, location, equipment details and any public email, phone number or website. Listings are labeled unclaimed and unverified and are not created or approved by the businesses shown."],
  ["How we use information", "We use information to operate and secure the website, publish permit leads and directory listings, send the permit-related emails described above, measure how the site is used, prevent abuse and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell personal information and we do not use permit or directory data to build profiles for advertising."],
  ["Who we share information with", "We use service providers to run the website: cloud hosting, a database provider, an email delivery provider, and Google if you allow analytics or marketing cookies. They process data only to provide their services to us. Permit and directory information is published on the website, so anyone who visits can view it. We may disclose information when the law requires it or to protect the website and its users."],
  ["Links to other websites", "This website may link to third-party websites, including directory listings' own websites. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content or privacy practices."],
  ["Your choices and requests", "If you received an email from us, use the \"Do not contact me again\" link in that email to stop further outreach to your address. You may ask us to review, correct or remove information about you that appears on this website. Depending on where you live, including California and Florida, you may have rights to know what personal information we hold, to request access, correction or deletion, and to opt out of sale or sharing (we do not sell or share personal information for cross-context advertising). We will not treat you differently for making a request. Removing a listing here does not remove the underlying government record, which is held by the issuing jurisdiction."],
  ["Retention and security", "Permit records are kept while they are useful for the portal and may be archived afterwards. Page-view logs are kept for as long as needed to understand site usage. Outreach history and unsubscribe records are kept so that we can honor opt-outs. We use industry-standard safeguards such as encrypted connections and restricted administrative access, but no online system is completely secure."],
  ["Children", "This website is intended for businesses and adults and is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children."],
  ["International visitors", "The website is operated from the United States. If you visit from elsewhere, your information may be processed in the United States, where data protection laws may differ from those in your country."],
  ["Changes to this policy", "We may update this policy by posting a revised version with a new effective date. Continued use of the website after an update means you accept the revised policy."],
];

---
<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy | SF Tree Removal" description="Privacy practices for the SF Tree Removal permit leads portal."><Header /><main class="bg-white pt-28 lg:pt-32"><section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-8 lg:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl"><span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-green-700">// Legal</span><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Effective September 20, 2026</p><p class="mt-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">This policy explains how SF Tree Removal collects, uses and shares information through this website, a public portal that publishes tree-related permit leads, a contractor directory and a blog for South Florida.</p><div class="mt-12 space-y-10">{sections.map(([title, text]) => <section><h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-950">{title}</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">{text}</p></section>)}</div></div></section></main><Footer /><MobileNav /></MainLayout>
